{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.72]Ring, do you hear me calling?\n[00:05.42](Purps on the beat)\n[00:07.80]Me no want no drama\n[Chorus]\n[00:11.80]Do you hear me calling?\n[00:14.50]Do you hear me calling?\n[00:17.22]Me no want no drama\n[00:18.84]Not a fighter, a lover\n[00:22.58]Do you hear me calling?\n[00:25.30]Do you hear me calling?\n[00:28.02]Me no want no drama\n[00:30.24]I just want you, my darling\n[Verse 1]\n[00:32.36]Break away and make a way to make it\n[00:35.12]Love the way you lookin' when you naked\n[00:37.76]Treat your heart just like a blunt of OG\n[00:40.52]Roll it up, I kissed it and I smoke it\n[00:43.12]Gots to be joking\n[00:44.52]Where in the fuck did you think you were going?\n[00:47.22]Foldin' and packin' your clothes like you ain't know I was gon' unfold it\n[00:51.26]Wine glass full of your emotions\n[00:53.78]Oh, Pinot Grigio, sippin', beautiful, heaven-soul woman\n[00:59.36]Me don't know, let me know, let me\n[01:02.06]In your heart, don't you dare forget me\n[01:04.72]I'm your fan, your posters on my walls inside my head, yeah, yeah\n[01:10.20]I'm your fan, your posters on my walls inside my head, yeah\n[Chorus]\n[01:16.54]Do you hear me calling?\n[01:19.22]Do you hear me calling?\n[01:21.92]Me no want no drama\n[01:24.62]Not a fighter, a lover\n[01:27.32]Do you hear me calling?\n[01:30.04]Do you hear me calling?\n[01:32.74]Me no want no drama\n[01:34.96]I just want you, my darling\n[Verse 2]\n[01:37.48]You drive me insane, no girl make me feel this way\n[01:39.80]Wait girl, you got your ways, girl, you are my getaway\n[01:42.50]Wait, let me keep you safe\n[01:43.88]In exchange, give me brain, brain\n[01:45.56]You my main thing, turn around, bang bang\n[01:47.96]Hit the beach in LA like you a beach ball\n[01:50.56]Me and you in the Lambo truck, you start it up and skrrt off\n[01:53.32]We park after dark at the park by the mansion, take your skirt off\n[01:56.08]Oh, me can't wait to get all up inside of it\n[01:58.74]My heart is racing, every time I'm tastin' it\n[02:01.40]Wait until the drugs fade out\n[02:02.74]Hate making love when I'm faded\n[02:04.06]That's because I wanna feel it\n[02:05.42]Girl, you give me the best feelin'\n[02:06.72]Yes, girl, you're the best, take away stress, love me to death\n[02:09.00]Even when I'm a mess\n[Chorus]\n[02:10.46]Do you hear me calling?\n[02:13.14]Do you hear me calling?\n[02:15.88]Me no want no drama\n[02:18.66]Not a fighter, a lover\n[02:21.24]Do you hear me calling?\n[02:34.74]Do you hear me calling?\n[02:45.00]Me no want no drama\n[02:56.00]I just want you, my darling (Darling)\n[Outro]\n[03:00.66]Ring, do you hear me calling?\n[03:02.84]Me no want no drama\n[03:04.16]Ring, do you hear me calling?\n[03:06.04]Me no want no drama","words":[[2.72,3.06,"Ring,"],[3.72,3.78,"do"],[3.86,3.92,"you"],[4.04,4.46,"hear"],[4.56,4.64,"me"],[4.76,5.38,"calling?"],[5.42,5.6,"(Purps"],[5.68,5.74,"on"],[5.88,5.96,"the"],[6.12,6.56,"beat)"],[7.8,7.86,"Me"],[7.96,8.04,"no"],[8.24,8.48,"want"],[8.64,8.72,"no"],[8.88,9.4,"drama"],[11.8,11.88,"Do"],[11.94,12.0,"you"],[12.14,12.52,"hear"],[12.64,12.7,"me"],[12.82,13.44,"calling?"],[14.5,14.56,"Do"],[14.66,14.72,"you"],[14.84,15.24,"hear"],[15.34,15.4,"me"],[15.54,16.16,"calling?"],[17.22,17.28,"Me"],[17.36,17.42,"no"],[17.56,17.88,"want"],[18.02,18.1,"no"],[18.22,18.8,"drama"],[18.84,19.9,"Not"],[19.98,19.98,"a"],[20.2,20.72,"fighter,"],[20.78,20.78,"a"],[20.94,21.52,"lover"],[22.58,22.66,"Do"],[22.74,22.82,"you"],[22.92,23.28,"hear"],[23.44,23.5,"me"],[23.64,24.24,"calling?"],[25.3,25.36,"Do"],[25.44,25.5,"you"],[25.62,26.02,"hear"],[26.12,26.2,"me"],[26.34,26.94,"calling?"],[28.02,28.06,"Me"],[28.16,28.22,"no"],[28.4,28.8,"want"],[28.84,28.88,"no"],[29.02,29.58,"drama"],[30.24,30.24,"I"],[30.36,30.62,"just"],[30.7,31.02,"want"],[31.1,31.16,"you,"],[31.36,31.56,"my"],[31.7,32.22,"darling"],[32.36,32.68,"Break"],[32.78,33.14,"away"],[33.18,33.28,"and"],[33.38,33.74,"make"],[33.8,33.8,"a"],[33.9,34.08,"way"],[34.24,34.3,"to"],[